unavailable facts, preserved old corrupt/unsupported failures; exact byte restoration and same product identity.\\\",\\n    \\\"impact_chain\\\": \\\"Formal editor global sorting to Planner/Runner shared timing, Host/admission/terminal and BGI boundary; freely chase frozen callers.\\\",\\n    \\\"prior_findings\\\": \\\"All original 99 findings/39 unknown keys structurally preserved plus slot1 new findings; original report blocked stays unchanged.\\\",\\n    \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Complete current BGI+assistant agreed functionality and formal WPF; concentrated slot1 repair verification, no new function or history certification.\\\",\\n    \\\"state\\\": \\\"Canonical primary entry, fresh round/cursor identity, absolute deadline and original external/LocalWait settlement.\\\",\\n    \\\"uncertainty\\\": \\\"Separate fake-boundary tests, actual quiet WPF boundary runs, original local migration/UI evidence and user-pending game/effects.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"effort\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-6.1-sol\\\",\\n  \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Two important normal path/timed-wait risks share durable arrival, stop and deadline settlement. Verify one stable repair and complete product scope with original obligations; fixed final owner slot, no new plan/function review.\\\",\\n  \\\"risk_unresolved\\\": true,\\n  \\\"stage\\\": \\\"implementation\\\"\\n}\\n\\r\\n{\\n  \\\"actual_scope\\\": \\\"Conditions are quiet finite native WPF workflow inputs at shared path/wait boundary. Resource side-effect rejection proven in fake-boundary Runner fixtures; actual game/resource/Skip/account/team/shutdown effects remain user-pending. Do not claim these from local conditions.\\\",\\n  \\\"historical_obligations\\\": \\\"Original open grades, keys, failures, SDK/tool/bundle/r61 gaps retained. Fixed owner complete-usable contract permits supported-version boundary retention, not fake closed.\\\",\\n  \\\"inherited_finding_keys\\\": 101,\\n  \\\"new_findings\\\": [\\n    \\\"PATH-STRUCTURAL-LOOP-ENTRY-1\\\",\\n    \\\"LOOP-CUTOFF-TIMED-NODE-1\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"no_legacy_permit_or_receipt\\\": true,\\n  \\\"original_39_unknown_keys\\\": 39,\\n  \\\"original_99_finding_keys\\\": 99,\\n  \\\"prior_report\\\": \\\"_slot1-report/report.json\\\",\\n  \\\"repair\\\": \\\"Four shared planner/runner sources plus finite PathLoopCutoffTests; real Rebuild/TRX/PFP and exact restored bytes; current same product finite actual boundary observation.\\\",\\n  \\\"unchanged_prior_dispositions\\\": \\\"Slot1 limited resolutions retained with original report/source; unchanged UI/migration/software-exit evidence reused only when dependency/conditions equivalent.\\\"\\n}\\n\\r\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"8238cb\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.2101666,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":2443,\"output\":\"{\\r\\n  \\\"findings\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"0538bb48b7318cc115e2fdc495035a23abf90dd151f406b4dbc88f1d0d31623a\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"0538bb48b7318cc115e2fdc495035a23abf90dd151f406b4dbc88f1d0d31623a\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"original\\\": {\\r\\n        \\\"closure_evidence\\\": [],\\r\\n        \\\"counterexample\\\": \\\"两个引用目标中，第一项 Added 已提交 F 和 Applied，第二项尚未执行即退出。重开必须接受第一项的真实归属，同时禁止把第二项当作已写入；沿用完整写集相等规则会拒绝这个合法中间态，放宽为任意子集又会丢失精确阶段约束。另一个反例是 Added 提交后被替换为字节相同、FileId 不同的外来文件：其 inputVersion 是不存在，不能继承输出身份；若 receipt 只包含现列出的哈希/长度，重开无法兑现身份吻合后才删除。方案所写“Stage 允许表必须显式枚举”尚不是该表。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"PLAN-VERSION-CHAIN-1\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"obligation\\\": \\\"plan\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"paths\\\": [\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v1.md:29\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v1.md:46\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v1.md:61\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:852\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1404\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1564\\\"\\r\\n        ],\\r\\n        \\\"repair_steps\\\": [\\r\\n          \\\"在同一方案中固定 schema2 全字段及摘要覆盖：事务/根身份、不可变登记、baseline 完整版本、operation kind/sequence/predecessor、Prepared 输入与确定性输出、Applied 完整 outputVersion；Added 的输出 FileId 必须来自实际创建句柄并与数据原子落盘。删除使用绑定输入身份的不存在输出及持久墓碑。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"给出全部阶段与每种操作的允许表，明确 Prepared、Applied、部分前缀、B/F/A/R/不存在/X、激活记录、确认集合、失败来源、提交标记的关系。未列组合默认拒绝；Blocked 根据保留的操作来源恢复，不能成为宽泛授权阶段。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"明确引用部分完成时确认集合恰等于有效 Applied 引用操作集合；阶段完成时才要求与全部登记相等。激活/撤销/恢复分别绑定对应已应用前驱，预测不得成为确认事实。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"规定恢复已 Applied 但当前 X 时仍阻断；精确 B 只允许已恢复的只读跳过，不能借其更新 R 或制造新的 Applied。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"明确 Prepared/blob 的持久化交易边界、Applied/data/manifest 的共同交易边界，以及 commit 未知后重新加载收据的流程。同步修订 plan.json 中仍描述旧检查加预测路线的执行段，保留旧文件作为历史而非另一份有效施工指令。\\\"\\r\\n        ],\\r\\n        \\\"root_cause\\\": \\\"统一版本协议的方向已补齐，但尚未形成完整可执行的持久化模式和允许表。PLAN-v1 仅要求未来显式枚举阶段；journal 字段列出 inputVersion/outputHash/outputLength/receipt，却未规定 Applied 收据中的完整输出文件身份、删除墓碑、部分成功集合与阶段关系。当前原校验要求写集与全部登记集合相等，不能直接承载逐项成功后的部分写集。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"severity\\\": \\\"must\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"status\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"tests\\\": [\\r\\n          \\\"PartialAddedWriteThenCancellation_ReopenConverges：第一项真实 Applied、第二项无 Applied，新实例合法加载并恢复。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"AppliedAddedReplacedBySameBytesDifferentFileId_IsPreserved：重开后零误删，不认领外来身份。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"JournalStageVersionMatrix_RejectsEveryUnlistedCombination：全阶段、操作种类与版本组合逐格枚举，包含非法 R 出现在 SnapshotReady/ReferenceUpdating/Activated/Committed。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"PreparedOutputWithoutApplied_IsNeverClaimed：即使输出字节相同仍不得认领。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"ReentryAfterBaselineActivationTargetRestored_Converges：显式 B 不等于 R、真实故障站点、新实例与终态重载。\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"分别突变输出身份校验、部分集合关系、Prepared/Applied 判别和 R 阶段限制；要求行为断言失败及完整 P/F/P。\\\"\\r\\n        ]\\r\\n      },\\r\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ad38c19cd8c347cfa461de14e7961fed/report.json\\\"\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    \\\"0647d07b0afcaf9b0fa9f5bc6828d63af6222b54599375acd39cc6dad4a8f4b7\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"0647d07b0afcaf9b0fa9f5bc6828d63af6222b54599375acd39cc6dad4a8f4b7\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"original\\\": {\\r\\n        \\\"closure_evidence\\\": [],\\r\\n        \\\"counterexample\\\": \\\"records为46条，矩阵57行；summary标题28，findings写45/42/23，checkpoint写45/39且仍安排round4。M31仍指向反复扰动旧测试；REF-F25注入时序、REF-F26旧恢复用例、M50描述、REF-C4状态和M4原因码击杀均不能支持所称覆盖。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"R5-IMPORTANT-7\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"obligation\\\": \\\"implementation\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"paths\\\": [\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/findings.md\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/owner-checkpoint.md\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/risk-matrix.json\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/mutations/records.json\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/mutations/summary.md\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/manifest.json\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R56ReferenceActivationWiringTests.cs\\\"\\r\\n        ],\\r\\n        \\\"repair_steps\\\": \\\"保留round1 IMPORTANT-9、round2 IMPORTANT-8、round3 IMPORTANT-7、round4 IMPORTANT-7和round5 IMPORTANT-7的全部子问题与原级。逐记录核对目标TestId、单点patch、实际断言和源码版本；M31改绑一次性反例并重跑，M50只声明守卫赋值被删除，REF-F25/F26按实际站点修正，REF-C4记适用但未验证。M4等仅原因码变化的击杀不得用来证明危险行为被阻止。旧数字保留为有日期历史，当前统计机器生成。重新取得当前版本认证三段执行，不能复用旧SHA记录。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"root_cause\\\": \\\"测试、突变、矩阵、发现与检查点没有统一到同一版本和真实执行路径；部分所谓击杀仅检测诊断变化。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"severity\\\": \\\"important\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"status\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"tests\\\": \\\"计数/映射一致性检查；双目标真实部分取消及PartialWriteReportsActualWritesNotRequestedCount；每个关键断言有baseline/mutant/restored认证执行及实际失败；runner互斥、开工前哨和收工逐字节恢复检查；源码与产物版本一致。\\\"\\r\\n      },\\r\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json\\\"\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    \\\"06b0ba77619e6b372efa5f9d6fb92ece485d228b4188ce3d00408c1813e9975a\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"06b0ba77619e6b372efa5f9d6fb92ece485d228b4188ce3d00408c1813e9975a\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"original\\\": {\\r\\n        \\\"closure_evidence\\\": [],\\r\\n        \\\"counterexample\\\": \\\"plan.json写审查manifest v2，但运行事务IsManifestIntegrityValidCore只接受schemaVersion=1。新增RevertedHash后，旧ActivationRecord摘要尾部从AfterHash变为AfterHash:<null>，旧合法记录在升级后LoadValidated返回null。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"PLAN-COMPATIBILITY-1\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"obligation\\\": \\\"plan\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"paths\\\": [\\r\\n          \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/plan.json\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs\\\",\\r\\n          \\\"__review__/git.json\\\"\\r\\n        ],\\r\\n        \\\"repair_steps\\\": \\\"区分workflow设施manifest v2与运行迁移manifest schemaVersion=1。明确旧运行证据的验证、受锁升级和恢复政策，列出旧Committed、Activated、RollingBack、Blocked和RolledBack记录的行为。禁止只用新算法重算旧摘要；先按原版本完整校验，再按明确版本写新记录。若旧版本有无法安全续做状态，具体登记阻断和恢复方法。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"root_cause\\\": \\\"兼容条款只有审查意向，没有针对实际摘要格式变化的迁移方法和验收条件。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"severity\\\": \\\"important\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"status\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"tests\\\": \\\"由变更前实现生成带真实ActivationRecord的manifest字节，升级后加载、恢复和授权测试；篡改旧摘要必须拒绝；兼容升级中断后新实例重开；无端口旧夹具回归。\\\"\\r\\n      },\\r\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json\\\"\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    \\\"09624e3da1a73206c08aa110478c8d1890774fec8d9f5d07a00d