ra 中均没有原 `_r56_parallel/report.md`、`_r56_parallel/acceptance.md` 或 r56-mainline-integration 的原报告/验收文件。parallel-original-receipt-recovery.json 引用的 retained_path 在本冻结 contracts 实际不存在。可以读 registry 的 R56-D1 登记定义和恢复哈希表，不能独立读取原报告/验收字节；原 ea975 未知的这部分尚不能全部关闭。已集成成果不因此变成待重复集成。\", \"source\": \"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/911b636e813d4487ba4c9bdfb791070c/checkpoints/2.json\"}\r\nU 8cce4c41dad60ad5c55e79bbd275a69267511ce562a52543df50f8d85a467052 {\"key\": \"8cce4c41dad60ad5c55e79bbd275a69267511ce562a52543df50f8d85a467052\", \"original\": \"当前证明矩阵未冻结，无法核验其逐风险场景、testId、共享突变及未证明部分的实际映射；不能由历史矩阵或manifest中的22个mutation摘要推定无误闭合。\", \"source\": \"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/d8212dc3eba4442db8dd131e6a73d3e8/report.json\"}\r\nU 8db492e6745c6cd9348625f54438249f18200e7b906601ba010a7d9afb373919 {\"key\": \"8db492e6745c6cd9348625f54438249f18200e7b906601ba010a7d9afb373919\", \"original\": \"本次仅通过冻结快照MCP进行静态审查，没有运行构建、测试、故障实验或突变。\", \"source\": \"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json\"}\r\nU 8e61523f8bc1ea2c24234a0c2cfd31eb48e93d71039f1efbd93227f991898b9d {\"key\": \"8e61523f8bc1ea2c24234a0c2cfd31eb48e93d71039f1efbd93227f991898b9d\", \"original\": \"原始rollout不在快照，无法独立确认六份复制请求之外没有失败、超时、重试或其他已发送请求；只能确认提供的六份请求与响应相互一致。\", \"source\": \"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json\"}\r\nU 8f2236ab33047c98972c760d1411ce74bf8c206b7596a751277911a531f38501 {\"key\": \"8f2236ab33047c98972c760d1411ce74bf8c206b7596a751277911a531f38501\", \"original\": \"当前 V15 manifest 的 46 份唯一 receipt 中有 45 份原件未冻结，c49 比较 final 的原认证闭包也缺失；派生 audit 不能替代这些原件。\", \"source\": \"_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/93c579f1dfd34055883bed3e18ac003c/report.json\"}\r\nU 9a6d38790b257d07292a6cfd8ed5da5a8024ee9e804